Package: OMICUE
Title: Tools for Multi-Omic Differential Analysis, Enrichment, and Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Rufei",
        family = "Lu",
        email = "rufei-lu@omrf.org",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: A collection of functions for wrangling multi-omic datasets
    (proteomics, transcriptomics, and similar assays), running
    differential-feature comparisons (Wilcoxon, logistic/linear regression,
    mixed-effects regression, and rank-based regression), performing gene
    set enrichment analysis against Gene Ontology, KEGG, and Reactome,
    building protein co-expression networks, and generating publication-
    style plots such as volcano plots, pathway heatmaps, circular
    Manhattan-style plots, and QC diagrams.
